        "subject": "LU-20080 quota: Check qsd_fini() race with qsd_op_end()",
        "message": "LU-20080 quota: Check qsd_fini() race with qsd_op_end()\n\nrecovery-small/143 suggests a race condition that could be hit\nwhere qsd_dev is NULL.\n\nAdd a qsd transaction counter and wait until it reaches 0\nbefore freeing the qsd resources.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testlist=sanity-quota\nSigned-off-by: Shaun Tancheff <shaun.tancheff@hpe.com>\nChange-Id: I13ad593fb9dbf143d799ac69a98d6a545134f8b4\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
